<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42101" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rŭtŭli</span></b> ,
		ōrum, m.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>An ancient people of Latium</i>, <i>whose capital was</i> Ardea, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 5,
				9, § 56</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Rep. 2,
				3, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 1, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">1, 57</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 1,
				266</span></i>; <i><span class="en">7, 472</span></i>; <i><span class="en">795</span></i> et saep.
			—In sing.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rŭtŭlus</span></b> , i,
			m., <i>a Rutulian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">audax,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 7, 409</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">8, 474</span></i>; <i><span class="en">9, 65 al.</span></i>—
			Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rŭtŭlus</span></b> , a, um,
				adj., <i>Rutulian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rex, i. e. Turnus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 9, 728</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">10, 267</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sanguis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 7, 318</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">11, 88: acies,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 12, 597</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caedes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 10, 245</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b> (<b>poet.</b>), <i>the inhabitants of Saguntum</i>, <i>a
				colony of Ardea</i>, <i><span class="en">Sil. 1, 584</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 541</span></i>; <i><span class="en">567 al.</span></i>—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> In gen., of <i>the Romans</i>, <i><span class="en">Sil. 10,
				450</span></i>; <i><span class="en">11,
			165</span></i>; in sing., of <i>a
			Roman</i>, <i><span class="en">id. 13, 163</span></i>.</div>
